{"title": "Undead Fortitude", "pageid": 21413, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Undead_Fortitude", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Death.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Generic_Death.webp/300px-Generic_Death.webp, /w/images/1/14/Generic_Death.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Generic_Death.webp/300px-Generic_Death.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Generic_Death.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Undead Fortitude</b> is a passive feature that prevents the user from being killed, unless hit with a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a> damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>If the killing blow wasn't a critical hit and wasn't radiant damage, this undead comes back to life with 1 hit point. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Actor\" title=\"Blighted Actor\">Blighted Actor</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Barman\" title=\"Blighted Barman\">Blighted Barman</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Patron\" title=\"Blighted Patron\">Blighted Patron</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Troubador\" title=\"Blighted Troubador\">Blighted Troubador</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Connor_Vinderblad\" title=\"Connor Vinderblad\">Connor Vinderblad</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fungal_Zombie\" title=\"Fungal Zombie\">Fungal Zombie</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Morbus\" title=\"Morbus\">Morbus</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Reanimated_Corpse\" title=\"Reanimated Corpse\">Reanimated Corpse</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sacrum\" title=\"Sacrum\">Sacrum</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thrumbo\" title=\"Thrumbo\">Thrumbo</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zombie\" title=\"Zombie\">Zombie</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zombie_(Animate_Dead)\" title=\"Zombie (Animate Dead)\">Zombie (Animate Dead)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zombie_Wulbren\" title=\"Zombie Wulbren\">Zombie Wulbren</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Undead Fortitude does not protect against being shoved, thrown, or otherwise forcibly displaced into chasms.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195554\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 696/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3841/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2519/4194